  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given equation is <math><mi>d</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mrow><msup><mrow><mi>e</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math><br />On integrating, we get,</p><p>&nbsp;<math><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#8747;</mo><mrow><mi>d</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mrow><msup><mrow><mi>e</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#8747;</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>sin</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mfenced><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>y</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>cos</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi></math><br />or <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mi>sin</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mfenced><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>y</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>cos</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>C</mi></math><br /><math><mo>&#8756;</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p>"
